      {
        "name": "TextBox 1",
        "id": 2,
        "left": 0,
        "top": 1059580,
        "width": 5361433,
        "height": 2585323,
        "type": "TEXT_BOX (17)",
        "text": "\nPROBLEM\u000bFarmers often see only the headline mandi price, while their actual earnings are reduced by transportation costs, mandi fees, storage expenses and crop spoilage. They also lack reliable price forecasts and direct access to suitable buyers, increasing their dependence on intermediaries.\n"
      },
      {
        "name": "TextBox 2",
        "id": 3,
        "left": 8206275,
        "top": 1286231,
        "width": 3985292,
        "height": 2031325,
        "type": "TEXT_BOX (17)",
        "text": "OUR IDEA\u000bSmartAgri is a single platform that helps farmers make better selling decisions by answering three questions:\u000b• WHERE to sell\n• WHEN to sell \n• WHOM to sell to"
      },
      {
        "name": "TextBox 3",
        "id": 4,
        "left": 1,
        "top": 3305158,
        "width": 5476774,
        "height": 3416320,
        "type": "TEXT_BOX (17)",
        "text": "PROPOSED SOLUTION\u000b• Net Realization Engine – identifies the market where the farmer can earn the highest profit after expenses.\u000b• Sell vs Hold Engine – recommends whether to sell immediately, wait, or sell partially based on price forecasts, spoilage and storage costs.\u000b• Direct Buyer Matching – connects farmers with suitable buyers based on price, quantity, distance and reliability.\u000b• Telugu AI Assistant – provides personalized market guidance through Telugu voice and text. \n\n"
      },
      {
        "name": "TextBox 4",
        "id": 5,
        "left": 8211868,
        "top": 3381625,
        "width": 4179754,
        "height": 3139321,
        "type": "TEXT_BOX (17)",
        "text": "INNOVATION & UNIQUENESS\n• Net Profit: Price → Actual Profit\u000b• Smart Timing: Forecast → Sell / Hold\u000b• Direct Link: Farmer → Buyer\u000b• Trust Score: Price + Reliability\u000b• Telugu AI: Voice + Text Advisory\u000b• One Decision: Data → Best Selling Option\nUSP:\u000bPRICE → PROFIT → DECISION\n"
      },
      {
        "name": "Picture 13",
        "id": 14,
        "left": 5616520,
        "top": 1477168,
        "width": 2219325,
        "height": 4543425,
        "type": "PICTURE (13)"
      }
    ]
  },
