        "width": 5794409,
        "height": 5262979,
        "type": "TEXT_BOX (17)",
        "text": "FRONTEND\u000bNext.js • React • Tailwind CSS\u000b→ Farmer-facing web interface\nBACKEND\u000bFastAPI • Python • REST APIs\u000b→ Handles application logic, calculations & requests\nDATABASE\u000bPostgreSQL • Supabase • SQLAlchemy\u000b→ Stores farmer, buyer, crop, market & transaction data\nAI & MACHINE LEARNING\u000bScikit-learn • XGBoost • Pandas • NumPy\u000b→ Price forecasting, data analysis & intelligent recommendations\nTELUGU AI\u000bSarvam AI\u000b→ Telugu voice & text-based farmer advisory\nDATA SOURCES\u000bAgmarknet • Market Data • Buyer Data • Location/Transport Data\u000b→ Provides the information required for market analysis\nCORE ENGINES\u000bNet Realization • Sell vs Hold • Buyer Matching\u000b→ Converts market data into actionable selling decisions"
      },
